                %em Heterotic compactifications with principal bundles for general groups and general levels
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0701244"} arXiv:hep-th/0701244
          %p
            On a subtlety in the application of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Narasimhan-Seshadri+theorem"} Narasimhan-Seshadri theorem
            in the duality:
